# A quick check of /antcolonies raid demo with no way given (2026-11-08): it should lay its trail the way of eight with the
# plainest ground, away from the dead mound's own dead tree. Read the "[raid] demo" line in the log; one picture from above.
#   ./gradlew runFilm -PfilmScene=tools/film/raid_demo_way.film
cmd time set 1000
lens 45
camera 0.5 -60 0.5 0 0
cmd antcolonies newmound dead 6
wait 200
camera 6.5 -60 0.5 0 0
cmd antcolonies matabele 120
wait 100
cmd antcolonies raid demo
wait 20
camera 0.5 -10 0.5 0 90
fov 70
wait 10
shot above
quit
